<ol><li>Qaid se jab rihaai haram paaenge</li><p>(kya mujhe chor kar sab chale jaaenge) x2</p><li>Kya isi qaid mei gut ke marjaaungi, kya mei do gaz kafan bhi nahi paaungi, mele kurte mei kya mujhko dafnaaenge</li><p>(kya mujhe chor kar sab chale jaaenge) x2</p><li>Sarse paaun talak mei lahu mei hu tar, mera zakhmon bhara ye badan dekh kar, sirf zaalim nahi zulm pashtaaenge</li><p>(kya mujhe chor kar sab chale jaaenge) x2</p><li>Shaam waale karenge abhi kuch sitam, mujhko khaae chala jaa raha hai ye gham, ye meri qabr pe shimr ko laaenge</li><p>(kya mujhe chor kar sab chale jaaenge) x2</p><li>Dekh kar zakhm baba ke ghabraayi mei, hashr mei baap ke paas jab aayi mei, dekh kar mujhko baba bhi ghabraaenge</li><p>(kya mujhe chor kar sab chale jaaenge) x2</p><li>Karbala hai kahaan aur kahaan shaam hai, na mujhe chain naa unko aaraam hai, woh mujhe karbala roz bulwaaenge</li><p>(kya mujhe chor kar sab chale jaaenge) x2</p><li>Karbala jaake baba se ye puchna, hashr mei unse jab ho mera saamna, kya mujhe apne sine se liptaaenge</li><p>(kya mujhe chor kar sab chale jaaenge) x2</p><li>Kehna sughra se apna chaman milgaya, ho mubarak tumhe to watan milgaya, hashr tak ham musaafir hi keh laaenge</li><p>(kya mujhe chor kar sab chale jaaenge) x2</p><li>Shaam mei hi meri shaam hojaaegi, ye kahaani agar aam hojaaegi, baap beti se kab pyaar farmaaenge</li><p>(kya mujhe chor kar sab chale jaaenge) x2</p><li>Ham na funkaar hai aur na ehle kalam, hai ye farhaano shoukat pe unka karam, hamse shabbir nauha kehel waaenge</li></ol>

